{"id":"664325","name":"芝麻五香烤饼","author":"红袖添香v","authorId":"11598100","desc":"","cover":"images/664325/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"花椒面","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉中加入发酵粉。","img":"images/664325/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"边倒水边用筷子搅拌成面絮。","img":"images/664325/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团，盖上盖子发酵至二倍大。","img":"images/664325/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碗中放入面粉、花椒面、盐。","img":"images/664325/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"浇入热油搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664325/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发好的面揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/664325/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"擀成薄片。","img":"images/664325/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"抹上油酥。","img":"images/664325/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"从一边卷起来。","img":"images/664325/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切大小均匀的面剂。","img":"images/664325/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"擀薄。","img":"images/664325/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"从两面折叠起来。","img":"images/664325/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"按扁后再从两面折叠。","img":"images/664325/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"一面刷上水沾上芝麻。","img":"images/664325/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放到烤盘上再发酵10分钟。","img":"images/664325/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放到烤箱中上、下管200度烤15分钟。","img":"images/664325/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"焦香酥脆、满屋飘香的芝麻五香烤饼，蘸上辣椒酱真的是囗感丰富、回味无穷，每一口都是味蕾的极致享受！","img":"images/664325/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}